    <mxCell id="esc-1" value="1. COMPRESS&#xa;• Summarize history/scratchpad&#xa;• steeringBudget halved&#xa;• shouldCompress = true" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="boundary-escalation">
      <mxGeometry x="10" y="50" width="360" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="esc-2" value="2. DROP-STEERING&#xa;• Remove steering documents from context&#xa;• minLoadout = true&#xa;• Only core tools remain" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="boundary-escalation">
      <mxGeometry x="390" y="50" width="360" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="esc-3" value="3. MIN-LOADOUT&#xa;• Core + Discovery tools only (cap = 1000 tokens)&#xa;• capExceeded = true if unreachable&#xa;• If still over budget → PiContextBudgetExceededError" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="boundary-escalation">
      <mxGeometry x="770" y="50" width="360" height="100" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="esc-formula" value="S_evict = Age×200 + Tokens − Referenced×1000&#xa;In-use/exempt = -Infinity&#xa;Tombstone: [evicted tool_call_id=&lt;id&gt;]&#xa;Batch evict at ~75% budget" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="boundary-escalation">
      <mxGeometry x="10" y="170" width="1120" height="60" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="boundary-gate" value="Budget Gate Wiring (extension/src/pi-agent/)" style="swimlane;startSize=30;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#9673a6;html=1;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
      <mxGeometry x="20" y="660" width="1140" height="120" as="geometry"/>
    </mxCell>
    <mxCell id="gate-components" value="• resolveContextBudget() — computes staticBudget from n_ctx&#xa;• tryRuntimeTokenCount(fetchFn) — llama.cpp /tokenize call&#xa;• runSessionBudgetGate() — orchestrates escalation chain&#xa;• scopedSteering() — role-scope reduction (BA 5→1 skills)&#xa;• RoleScopeFilter — 8 operating roles + fail-open (unknown=5)&#xa;• buildSessionToolLoadout() — BA excludes deploy/git/build, DEV keeps git/build&#xa;• DefaultResourceLoader wired for steering (no new code)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f3e5f5;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="boundary-gate">
      <mxGeometry x="10" y="50" width="1120" height="80" as="geometry"/>
